      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOWELLED UP (4) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at Launceston in a handy 30.00 beating Goodnight Heidi. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Can make it back-to-back wins. LIZZY'S GIRL (3) was a course and distance placegetter (26.29) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 8 length second in a Grade 5. Rates a key player. AVANT DANGER (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Launceston over 515m behind Zipping Emily (30.95) in a Restricted WIN. Was in the money prior to that. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SCARRED (5) was in the money last start from this box and should feature again.",
